# AutoHarp audio — do not "fix" these again

The glitchy click is a **discontinuity or render hitch**, not a short envelope.

## Engine

Build once. Rotate, screenshot, and system sounds must never `rebuild`, `connect`, `stop`, or `setActive(false)`. If the engine already stopped, only `start()`. Reconnect only if `start()` fails. Loading a sound into a sampler is not a graph rebuild.

## Audio thread

Write samples. No `MIDISend`, no `dispatch_async`, no graph rebuild. MIDI is sent off the audio thread.
